awled out of), 21 years old, known to the police. He was classified as an &quot;Islamist threat&quot; and was supposed to attend a &quot;deradicalization course&quot; today.</p>\n<p>Folks, this shit simply cannot go on! We have to put an end, once and for all, to handling these shitty, fucking, filthy Muslims with kid gloves!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 18, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC04qQVf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 13, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8747953, "raw_content": "", "author": "d003", "created": 1785079737056, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LORDFALCONE", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "theworldwatch.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC04qQVf.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://theworldwatch.com/videos/1617963/you-ll-never-guess-what-they-found-in-school-lunches-when-sent-to-a-lab/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Lab testing school lunches says MORE TOXINS than NUTRIENTS", "last_comment_created": 1785083476240, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 13, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "<div>40 different school lunches were taken, frozen and sent to an independent lab for testing</div> <div>